  "note": "The three v1 reference clips were cut by hand, before scripts/videogen/cut.py existed. Each was cut from a metadata-stripped copy of its source with the recipe below, at ffmpeg 6.1.1 on aarch64, with libx264's default thread count. cut.py adds -threads 8, -map_metadata:s:v -1 and -map_chapters -1, so a recut with cut.py is not expected to match these sha256 values byte for byte. The clips, sources and frames stay in ~/bench-logs/videogen/; only their names, windows and hashes are here.",
